---
description: >-
  Marble diagram under the dark theme, checking that every marble color comes
  from theme variables rather than hardcoded values: retry(2) resubscribing to
  a source that errors.
config:
  theme: dark
---
marble-beta
  title retry(2)
  axis    : 0    5
  "try 1" : -a-#
  "try 2" :    -a-#
  "try 3" :       -a-#
  result  : -a--a--a-#
  label a "value"
  label # "error"
